    text: A landscape painting in a dark wooden frame. Calm misty pine trees and
      distant hills.
  stateBLines:
  - speaker: Adrian
    expression: Scared
    text: THE PAINTING CHANGED! Two tall, dark figures are standing between the trees!
      They weren't there before!
  - speaker: Adrian
    expression: Scared
    text: And dark liquid is dripping down the wallpaper beneath the frame...
  triggerRadius: 1.6
