  stateALines:
  - speaker: Adrian
    expression: Neutral
    text: My wardrobe. Securely shut. Extra winter blankets and jackets are stored
      inside.
  stateBLines:
  - speaker: Adrian
    expression: Scared
    text: THE WARDROBE DOOR IS WIDE OPEN! The wood around the latch was splintered
      from the INSIDE!
  - speaker: Adrian
    expression: Scared
    text: And there are dark wet barefoot prints leading from my bed right into the
      wardrobe!
  triggerRadius: 1.96
